influence|Power/effect noun and direct-object verb are distinguished. Career and weather examples preserve direction of effect; grammar guards against transferring noun influence on to transitive verb usage.
recycle|Processing for reuse rather than merely collecting is the boundary. Paper-to-notebook-material context and into complement align in Vietnamese without claiming every material is recyclable.
speech|Audience address and spoken expression/ability separated. Opening thanks and clear actor speech each match their intended boundary; Vietnamese does not add medical or speech-impairment facts.
well-being|Welfare includes physical and mental dimensions rather than a diagnosis. Can support remains a possibility in Vietnamese; breaks are not presented as a guaranteed health intervention.
aggregate|Adjective source evidence retained for combined cost; three workshops are preserved exactly in translation. No noun aggregate material or verb sense is invented to increase counts.
